  "notes": "{渡|わた}す means to hand over or pass something to someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{渡|わた}る→渡る：02441_wataru⟧ (intransitive, to cross)\n\nUSAGE:\n1. To hand over: ⟦{書類|しょるい}→書類：01103_shorui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}す (hand over documents)\n2. To ferry across: ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{対岸|たいがん}→対岸：17100_taigan⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{渡|わた}す (ferry someone across)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}す: to hand X to someone\n- ⟦{手|て}{渡|わた}す→手渡す：12757_tewatasu⟧: to hand directly\n- ⟦{引|ひ}き{渡|わた}す→引き渡す：12486_hikiwatasu⟧: to hand over (formal/legal)\n- ⟦{受|う}け{渡|わた}す→受け渡す：21475_ukewatasu⟧: to deliver, pass on\nA⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{渡|わた}す: to hand A to B",
